<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="LST1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel">Example issue description <math id="LST1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{\textrm{issue}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>issue</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{\textrm{issue}}</annotation></semantics></math>, based on SWE-PolyBench instance <span id="LST1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">apache__rocketmq-516</span>.</p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
